// A buried cargo halt, from the platform hall west into the warehouse to the chest, with the rope gun (no wall
// climbing): at each crate stack (4.25 m) the hook goes up into the hall's ceiling just ahead, W grabs the rope, W
// climbs it, and A rolls off it onto the stack's top; down the far side and on. Every 200 ticks the script throws,
// walks 25 ticks, climbs with W+A, then jumps (letting go of a rope it didn't need). Back east to the chest. The halt
// is 80 m long, so the scenario starts inside (the harness world is 128 m wide). Layouts from PR #8.
map
